Power Connections

- Arduino 5V → OLED VCC, Ultrasonic Sensor VCC
- Arduino GND → Common Ground for all components
- Servo motors should preferably use a separate regulated 5V power supply for reliable operation. Connect the external power supply GND to the Arduino GND (common ground).

Note

- Double-check all wiring before powering the circuit.
- Ensure all grounds are connected together (common ground).
- Use 220Ω resistors with each LED to limit current.
- Keep wiring neat and secure to improve reliability and presentation.